Depends: linux-image-@KVER@ (= @KVERSION@), raspi-firmware, kmod, udev
Description: CardputerZero drivers for the pinned kernel
 The M5Stack CardputerZero drivers (keyboard, audio codec, IO expander, fuel
 gauge, IMU, power-fail) from m5stack-linux-dtoverlays @M5COMMIT@, and
 CPZeroOS's panel driver with scan sync, built for @KVER@. Also the device
 tree overlays, udev rules, firmware files and the fb_load boot logo.
